    "version_difference": "CN contains 357 physical lines and no final newline; EN contains 358 because it has one final newline. Both sources contain 205 named text positions at identical physical line numbers and 152 command lines. All command lines match exactly in name, parameters, order and position. No placeholders or inline markup occur in dialogue payloads. CN is primary for meaning; EN Yostar is the name and structure cross-check. Full source scripts are not stored in this repository."
